    "extracted_answer": "[100, '100^\\\\circ']",
    "gold_answer": "The angles around a point sum to $360^\\circ$, so $x^\\circ + x^\\circ + 160^\\circ = 360^\\circ$.  Simplifying gives $2x^\\circ + 160^\\circ = 360^\\circ$, so $2x^\\circ = 200^\\circ$ and $x=\\boxed{100}$.",
